/v1/","context":{"app_id":4856380,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4856380-1839676055895787","game_id":"steam-4856380","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | v0.2","summary":"Hey, Rats!We hope you're having a great time with the demo! If you run into any bugs, have suggestions, or just want to share your feedback, don't hesitate to post in the Discussions.And if you're enjoying the game, don't forget to WISHLIST, it really helps us a lot. ❤️ Here's a small patch we've prepared:added a checkpoint save after the boss fight;improved network synchronization;fixed audio dropouts during gunfire;optimized FMOD audio performance;fixed the SMG reload bug.Thanks for playing, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T20:26:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856380-1839676055887491","game_id":"steam-4856380","kind":"announcement","title":"Just Rats Demo Release","summary":"We’ve finally moved on from the playtest and are happy to announce the release of the Just Rats Demo. In this demo, your team is trapped in a small suburb surrounded by pigs. Your objective is to survive the pig invasion by fighting through as many waves as you choose, defeat the boss, and evacuate safely. Thank you for playing the demo. We look forward to your feedback, and we hope you enjoy your time in Just Rats ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T08:33:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856380-1836506165547964","game_id":"steam-4856380","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update | v0.02","summary":"Fixed:Fixed NPC desynchronization on clients.Fixed weapon desynchronization on clients.Fixed an issue with the weapon crate door.Fixed a ladder that was not functioning correctly on the client side.Improved player animation synchronization.Fixed an issue where the attacker was not correctly registered when using the C.O.O.K.I.E weapon.Temporarily removed the ability to break doors while the mechanic is being reworked.Fixed an incorrectly positioned puddle on the platform.Added:Added a new Genera","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T05:59:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547964","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856380-1835871199314891","game_id":"steam-4856380","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Release","summary":"Hello everyone!We're happy to announce that the closed playtest for Just Rats is now live. Version 0.01 is available to play!The current build features one detailed map and a Deathmatch game mode. So grab your friends (or your lovers) and start chasing rats around the neighborhood!As this is an early test version, we're especially interested in bug reports and feedback. If you encounter any issues, please use the in-game feedback form or post them in the Steam Discussions section.We're particula","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T08:16:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199314891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4856380-1835871199305158","game_id":"steam-4856380","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Announcement","summary":"We're excited to announce that the closed invitation-only playtest for JUST RATS is coming soon!A selected group of players will get early access to the game and help us test gameplay, balance, performance, and uncover any issues before release.If you're invited, your feedback will play an important role in shaping the future of JUST RATSStay tuned for more details. Cheers,JUST RATS Team 🐁","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T18:20:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4856380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4856380":"2026-10-26T04:46:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4856380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4987310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4856380","app_id":4856380,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:02Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8594c722dd1abc5c3dbee30b68c1c6e5ebcef971bee55886693c524e84a3d858","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Co-op survival against relentless waves of pigs for up to 6 players.","publishers":[{"name":"Numinxter"}],"developers":[{"name":"Numinxter"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date